{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-condition--1","instance--763adce8-107c-58c1-9b65-18fefd501b17","instance--c08fb540-8872-51c1-8496-283e65fd40a2","user-account--2","instance--7797ff9e-6685-5e18-adfb-c4d44716e06f","instance--813e024b-d3d5-5a1b-b2fb-8afb64703462","user-account--3","instance--3536a568-610f-5570-bba9-6dfe97bc9c2e","instance--fb1118d0-336c-5935-b063-da32890e1042","instance--e5e1f9aa-9fe9-5106-95bc-0f29bb985397","instance--6d5cbf5c-5a40-513f-aaaa-67375fd01db0","instance--e67041e8-3358-5f72-801c-5b6aa01d1fce","instance--1fa3126a-bb58-563e-a616-464bda46b52f","instance--b2f0fb3e-20a8-5e7f-bb11-04f3a2e6eb5a","instance--7735582a-d3c6-5e9c-95c8-06993d21d964"],"properties":[["name","Mimikatz DCSync Usage, Exploitation, and Detection"],["description","A major feature added to Mimkatz in August 2015 is \u201cDCSync\u201d which effectively \u201cimpersonates\u201d a Domain Controller and requests account password data from the targeted Domain Controller."],["scope","incident"],["author",[["name","Sean Metcalf"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","adsecurity.org"],["url","https://adsecurity.org/?p=1729"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Run DCSync against krbtgt"],["description","Once the account is delegated the ability to replicate objects, the account can run Mimikatz DCSync:\n\nmimikatz \u201clsadump::dcsync /domain:rd.adsecurity.org /user:krbtgt\u201d"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1003.006"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Run DCSync against Administrator"],["description","Targeting an admin account with DCSync can also provide the account\u2019s password history (in hash format). Since there are LMHashes listed it may be possible to crack these and gain insight into the password strategy the admin uses. This may provide the attacker to guess the next password the admin uses if access is lost.\n\nmimikatz \u201clsadump::dcsync /domain:rd.adsecurity.org /user:Administrator\u201d"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1003.006"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","It is possible to use a regular domain user account to run DCSync. The combination of the following three rights need to be delegated at the domain level in order for the user account to successfully retrieve the password data with DCSync:\n\nReplicating Directory Changes ( )\n\nReplicating Directory Changes All ( )\n\nOnce the account is delegated the ability to replicate objects, the account can run Mimikatz DCSync:"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--79135dd4-1ee4-5416-8f25-699a951afa80","120":"instance--3087ed8f-f52f-5bc8-8c62-f9ae3264725f","150":"instance--57ed80e6-51e6-50f7-aad0-39bb33df0261","180":"instance--c5faf3bc-2d22-54bc-898b-31882ba7c4a4","210":"instance--766332d8-d34d-5820-9442-c32dc1a417ad","240":"instance--bca47815-218d-563d-b96b-55ff17065443","270":"instance--7ff5ac74-4c1f-50b0-b02f-b897e172a434","30":"instance--cc8cae0a-dc95-5e3f-bdd0-23dd9cfca432","300":"instance--bdad0536-1d47-52b9-ab72-1c7a08158f20","330":"instance--16d7e8d9-53cf-5ae9-a219-2047733c1b5d","60":"instance--872a3352-ab12-5fc6-993d-6b22b7bc0454","90":"instance--e6a727e3-1e85-552c-b938-189e11fc5d41"},"id":"software","instance":"instance--763adce8-107c-58c1-9b65-18fefd501b17","properties":[["evidence",[["item-1",{"citation":null,"excerpt":"Once the account is delegated the ability to replicate objects, the account can run Mimikatz DCSync:\n\nmimikatz \u201clsadump::dcsync /domain:rd.adsecurity.org /user:krbtgt\u201d","source":"https://adsecurity.org/?p=1729","source_field":"normalized_text","source_object_id":null}]]],["display_name","Mimikatz"],["name","Mimikatz"],["diagram_instance","instance--763adce8-107c-58c1-9b65-18fefd501b17"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--e6a7f5c0-5554-5a4c-bf1d-58b3786def94","120":"instance--cf3c3ccb